Third-party / interoperability notes:

- This project's `applicationId` intentionally matches a third-party app — either
  "Kugou Music Lite" / 酷狗音乐概念版 (com.kugou.android.lite) or "Luna Music"
  (com.luna.music), depending on the build variant — in order to be recognized
  by a vivo OriginOS system feature (the native "OriginPlayer" media widget)
  that is keyed by package name (see README.md and docs/DEV.md). This license
  covers only the original code in this repository. It does not grant any
  rights to, and this project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
  associated with Kugou, Luna, or vivo. Build and use at your own risk, for
  personal purposes, on your own device.

- This project is a companion to origin-isle (github.com/fvhde/origin-isle),
  same maintainer, same signing key. Neither project's reverse-engineered
  interoperability details are anyone's intellectual property; they are
  documented here for interoperability and educational purposes.
